   "source": [
    "# Maganor Mini: Digital Safety Data Processor\n",
    "## Project Purpose\n",
    "This project process fictional or anonymized reports of online harassment.\n",
    "## Objectives\n",
    "1.Load raw report data\n",
    "2.Clean missing ,duplicated, and invalid values.\n",
    "3.Analyze numerical data using Numpy.\n",
    "4.Generate a summary of the processed data.\n",
    "5.Export the results to CSV.\n",
    "## privacy\n",
    "This project uses synthetic data for development and testing.\n",
    "It doesn't identify victims or make automated safety decisions.\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
